OL,3,GNEWSAOrgreave Inquiry holds community
OL,4,Alistening events
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe independent Orgreave Inquiry,
OL,7,Fannounced by the government in July
OL,8,F2025, will examine planning around the
OL,9,Fpolicing of the demonstration, events
OL,10,Fon the day itself and charging
OL,11,Fdecisions following the arrests made.
OL,13,FAnyone connected to the incident is
OL,14,Finvited to attend listening events in
OL,15,FBarnsley on 28 October and Durham on 12
OL,16,FNovember.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
